### ==========================================
### 1. 認證與帳號流程
### ==========================================

### 1.1 註冊新帳號
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester123",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "USER"
}

### 1.2 登入取得 Token (請複製回傳的 token)
# @name userLogin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester123",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1.3 取得我的個人資料 (測試 DTO 與 /me 路徑)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.token}}


### ==========================================
### 2. 商品業務流程
### ==========================================

### 2.1 查詢所有商品 (公開 API)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 管理員登入 (取得 admin token)
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "shengjun_tes",
  "password": "password1234"
}

### 2.3 管理員新增商品
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJzaGVuZ2p1bl90ZXMiLCJyb2xlIjoiUk9MRV9BRE1JTiIsImlhdCI6MTc4NDQ2NTU0NiwiZXhwIjoxNzg0NTUxOTQ2fQ.7ww1cq8ZirxN821cHsHpPmR1aFrke03_KjCUjwhr5m8
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "測試商品",
  "price": 100.0,
  "stock": 50
}


### ==========================================
### 3. 購物車與訂單流程
### ==========================================

### 3.1 加入購物車 (需使用者權限)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/add?userId=1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJzaGVuZ2p1bl90ZXMiLCJyb2xlIjoiUk9MRV9BRE1JTiIsImlhdCI6MTc4NDQ2NTU0NiwiZXhwIjoxNzg0NTUxOTQ2fQ.7ww1cq8ZirxN821cHsHpPmR1aFrke03_KjCUjwhr5m8
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 3.2 查詢購物車
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJzaGVuZ2p1bl90ZXMiLCJyb2xlIjoiUk9MRV9BRE1JTiIsImlhdCI6MTc4NDQ2NTU0NiwiZXhwIjoxNzg0NTUxOTQ2fQ.7ww1cq8ZirxN821cHsHpPmR1aFrke03_KjCUjwhr5m8

### 3.3 執行一鍵結帳
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJzaGVuZ2p1bl90ZXMiLCJyb2xlIjoiUk9MRV9BRE1JTiIsImlhdCI6MTc4NDQ2NTU0NiwiZXhwIjoxNzg0NTUxOTQ2fQ.7ww1cq8ZirxN821cHsHpPmR1aFrke03_KjCUjwhr5m8

### 3.4 查詢我的訂單
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/my
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJzaGVuZ2p1bl90ZXMiLCJyb2xlIjoiUk9MRV9BRE1JTiIsImlhdCI6MTc4NDQ2NTU0NiwiZXhwIjoxNzg0NTUxOTQ2fQ.7ww1cq8ZirxN821cHsHpPmR1aFrke03_KjCUjwhr5m8


### ==========================================
### 4. 錯誤處理與安全測試 (驗證全域異常)
### ==========================================

### 4.1 越權測試: 使用一般會員嘗試刪除商品 (預期: 403 Forbidden)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.token}}

### 4.2 錯誤測試: 查詢不存在的用戶 (預期: 400 Bad Request + 自定義訊息)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/not_exist_user
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}